  "description": "<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial;\">A Whole Food, Fruit &amp; Veggie Nutrition Bar, Based on The Mediterranean Diet and MIND Diet.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial;\">Each bar is made with premium, 100% whole food ingredients that provide the antioxidants, anti-inflammatories, prebiotic fiber, healthy fats, and micronutrients our brains and bodies need to get and stay healthy.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\">&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial;\"></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">One look at the ingredient list and you&rsquo;ll see that our Fruit &amp; Veggie Bars are unlike any other nutrition bar:</span></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\">\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&frac12; cup of leafy greens</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&frac12; cup red &amp; orange vegetables&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&frac14; to &frac12; cup of berries and fruit</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&frac14; cup of nuts, seeds, and pseudo grains</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">The unfortunate reality is that most people struggle to eat enough fruits &amp; vegetables. In fact, only 10% of adults do so. This leaves their brains and bodies starved of the critical nutrients needed to thrive.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Our Fuit &amp; Veggie bars make it super convenient for people to get the foods their brains and bodes are hungry for.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Good Thinking bars come in three flavors; Blueberry Almond, Strawberry Cashew, and Cherry Walnut. They&rsquo;re available online at </span><a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"http://www.goodthinkingfoods.com\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">www.goodthinkingfoods.com</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">. A box of 12 bars sells for $43.99.</span></p>",
